1
00:00:36,850 --> 00:00:42,490
[She's Wild Fire]

2
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:47,560
[Episode 16 The Beginning of Shencheng]

3
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,450
They're unsalable?

4
00:00:51,680 --> 00:00:52,410
Stop joking.

5
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,770
Not so busy anymore?

6
00:01:02,400 --> 00:01:03,280
It's normal.

7
00:01:03,280 --> 00:01:05,330
It's normal to lose an order or two.

8
00:01:05,349 --> 00:01:06,550
Just a little hiccup.

9
00:01:07,680 --> 00:01:08,800
Here we go again.

10
00:01:12,039 --> 00:01:13,500
Cancelling the contract?

11
00:01:13,560 --> 00:01:14,320
But the contract is already signed!

12
00:01:14,320 --> 00:01:15,450
How can we cancel it?

13
00:01:22,680 --> 00:01:24,320
Now I get it.

14
00:01:24,800 --> 00:01:27,800
You came here today specifically
to make fun of me, didn't you?

15
00:01:27,800 --> 00:01:28,600
Get out.

16
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,360
Both of you, get out of here.

17
00:01:30,360 --> 00:01:31,360
Get out right now!

18
00:01:31,520 --> 00:01:33,380
Director Chang, I actually think

19
00:01:33,400 --> 00:01:35,960
you probably don't
want me to leave just yet.

20
00:01:36,720 --> 00:01:37,840
What do you mean?

21
00:01:38,940 --> 00:01:41,460
I can buy all your machines.

22
00:01:41,759 --> 00:01:45,000
After all, you don't have any orders now.

23
00:01:45,200 --> 00:01:46,780
Leaving them here is just a waste.

24
00:01:45,280 --> 00:01:46,350
[Equipment Transfer Contract]

25
00:01:50,520 --> 00:01:51,320
Are you crazy?

26
00:01:51,360 --> 00:01:53,600
I paid three million for this equipment.

27
00:01:53,600 --> 00:01:55,240
And you want to buy it for 200,000?

28
00:01:55,240 --> 00:01:56,240
Get out of here now

29
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,690
before you make me lose my mind!

30
00:01:57,690 --> 00:01:59,820
It's up to you whether you want to sell.

31
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,880
Director Chang.

32
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,400
Biao.

33
00:02:07,400 --> 00:02:08,930
What brings you here, Biao?

34
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:10,680
Your loan...

35
00:02:11,240 --> 00:02:12,480
is due today.

36
00:02:13,320 --> 00:02:14,000
Biao.

37
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,800
Look, as you can see.

38
00:02:16,079 --> 00:02:17,560
I just brought in all this new equipment,

39
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,480
so cash flow is a bit tight right now.

40
00:02:19,480 --> 00:02:21,000
How about next month?

41
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:23,000
I'll definitely pay you next month.

42
00:02:24,020 --> 00:02:25,140
I said today

43
00:02:25,680 --> 00:02:26,600
is the due date.

44
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:27,760
Biao.

45
00:02:27,760 --> 00:02:28,600
Don't.

46
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,600
Calm down.

47
00:02:29,720 --> 00:02:30,250
I'll pay.

48
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:30,680
I'll pay.

49
00:02:30,680 --> 00:02:31,740
I'll pay right now.

50
00:02:33,200 --> 00:02:34,730
Just give me a second, Biao.

51
00:02:38,320 --> 00:02:38,920
Ms. Xie.

52
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:40,800
200,000.

53
00:02:41,240 --> 00:02:42,970
I'll sell it to you for 200,000.

54
00:02:43,720 --> 00:02:44,400
What?

55
00:02:47,200 --> 00:02:48,200
I said 200,000.

56
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:50,030
I'll sell it all to you, okay?

57
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,920
Didn't you just say I was trying

58
00:02:51,920 --> 00:02:54,120
to take advantage of you and extort you?

59
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:56,720
Please, Ms. Xie. Be the bigger person.

60
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:59,000
Just let it slide, please.

61
00:03:22,320 --> 00:03:23,400
I'll do it.

62
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,240
Biao.

63
00:03:29,160 --> 00:03:30,000
I understand.

64
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:31,000
Got it, Biao.

65
00:03:31,920 --> 00:03:32,920
Got it, Biao.

66
00:03:33,760 --> 00:03:34,520
Hurry up!

67
00:03:34,920 --> 00:03:35,800
Sure, Biao.

68
00:03:38,600 --> 00:03:39,530
It's done, Biao!

69
00:03:40,400 --> 00:03:41,280
Ms. Xie,

70
00:03:41,730 --> 00:03:44,450
you mentioned that the industry would
cool down in the second half of the year,

71
00:03:44,450 --> 00:03:46,850
but we're buying machinery right now.

72
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:50,000
Now that orders
in Shencheng are already drying.

73
00:03:51,740 --> 00:03:52,140
Zhi,

74
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:53,290
remember one thing:

75
00:03:54,560 --> 00:03:56,040
Be fearful

76
00:03:56,160 --> 00:03:57,490
when others are greedy,

77
00:03:57,960 --> 00:03:59,400
and greedy

78
00:04:00,970 --> 00:04:02,370
when others are fearful.

79
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:04,000
Chang Yongbin only sees

80
00:04:04,000 --> 00:04:06,200
the small slice of the pie in Shencheng.

81
00:04:06,880 --> 00:04:08,400
But my Fashion Flower

82
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:11,120
is going nationwide.

83
00:04:12,720 --> 00:04:14,520
Then we'll send
the sales team out right away

84
00:04:14,520 --> 00:04:16,579
to drum up orders across the country.

85
00:04:16,880 --> 00:04:17,480
No need.

86
00:04:18,640 --> 00:04:21,970
I'm going to bring the whole
country's market to Shencheng.

87
00:04:24,240 --> 00:04:24,920
Biao, how about this?

88
00:04:24,920 --> 00:04:26,080
Take this 200,000 for now,

89
00:04:26,080 --> 00:04:28,000
and I'll pay off the rest bit by bit.

90
00:04:28,000 --> 00:04:28,880
Chang Yongbin,

91
00:04:30,400 --> 00:04:31,660
don't miss me too much.

92
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,740
I'll come back next month.

93
00:04:34,960 --> 00:04:35,890
Take care, Biao.

94
00:04:47,960 --> 00:04:49,020
Congratulations.

95
00:04:49,320 --> 00:04:51,250
Your new factory is finally built.

96
00:04:52,440 --> 00:04:54,640
You've got such a beautiful office now,

97
00:04:55,120 --> 00:04:56,760
and you even bought a batch of

98
00:04:56,780 --> 00:04:57,900
used equipment

99
00:04:58,520 --> 00:04:59,650
from Chang Yongbin.

100
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,840
Likewise.

101
00:05:02,840 --> 00:05:04,520
If you hadn't set the stage,

102
00:05:04,840 --> 00:05:07,100
how could I have
pulled this off on my own?

103
00:05:07,680 --> 00:05:09,200
Then our cooperation

104
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,000
can be considered

105
00:05:11,840 --> 00:05:12,840
flawless, right?

106
00:05:13,360 --> 00:05:15,220
Unmatched anywhere in the world.

107
00:05:18,440 --> 00:05:19,000
Alright.

108
00:05:19,600 --> 00:05:20,730
Let's go celebrate?

109
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:22,800
Let's go.

110
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:23,460
Celebrate!

111
00:05:28,440 --> 00:05:29,920
The matter with Chang Yongbin

112
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,560
is finally behind us.

113
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:33,800
That's all thanks to you, Mr. Chu.

114
00:05:36,000 --> 00:05:36,480
Here.

115
00:05:36,510 --> 00:05:37,200
Try it.

116
00:05:42,159 --> 00:05:45,040
It does look pretty plain,

117
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,400
but I'm sure it tastes just as good.

118
00:05:47,600 --> 00:05:48,310
Trust me.

119
00:06:04,840 --> 00:06:05,520
This is...

120
00:06:08,400 --> 00:06:10,120
It's the same flavor as that restaurant's.

121
00:06:10,120 --> 00:06:12,400
I asked the chef there for advice

122
00:06:12,760 --> 00:06:15,760
and practiced for days
using the method you taught me.

123
00:06:23,880 --> 00:06:25,000
Does it hurt?

124
00:06:25,760 --> 00:06:26,400
No.

125
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:28,840
From now on, whatever you want to eat,

126
00:06:28,840 --> 00:06:30,560
I'll learn how to make it.

127
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:31,200
Okay?

128
00:06:32,130 --> 00:06:34,460
You're the CEO of a publicly listed group.

129
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,120
Are you going to cook for me every day?

130
00:06:36,120 --> 00:06:38,120
Cooking is indeed much harder

131
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,650
than negotiating deals
or handling mergers,

132
00:06:40,880 --> 00:06:43,880
but I also think it's more worthwhile.

133
00:06:55,640 --> 00:06:56,370
Director Li,

134
00:06:56,640 --> 00:06:57,120
please.

135
00:06:57,120 --> 00:06:57,680
Okay.

136
00:06:58,240 --> 00:06:59,000
Nanfeng,

137
00:06:59,480 --> 00:07:01,520
this is Director Li.

138
00:07:01,720 --> 00:07:02,850
Hello, Director Li.

139
00:07:03,240 --> 00:07:05,900
I'm Xie Nanfeng,
the founder of Fashion Flower.

140
00:07:05,960 --> 00:07:08,090
I've heard Mr. Chu speak highly of you.

141
00:07:08,120 --> 00:07:11,100
You're a role model for
women entrepreneurs in Shencheng.

142
00:07:11,100 --> 00:07:12,040
You flatter me, sir.

143
00:07:12,040 --> 00:07:12,600
Please have a seat.

144
00:07:12,600 --> 00:07:13,240
Okay.

145
00:07:15,560 --> 00:07:16,600
The reason we invited you today

146
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:18,000
is to discuss plans

147
00:07:18,120 --> 00:07:20,280
for the plot of land in Xie Village.

148
00:07:20,440 --> 00:07:22,400
I plan to build the country's

149
00:07:22,400 --> 00:07:24,520
largest clothing trade center there.

150
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:26,070
It will integrate wholesale,

151
00:07:26,070 --> 00:07:29,640
retail, warehousing, logistics,
and design into a single platform.

152
00:07:29,640 --> 00:07:32,440
I want to make
a complete commercial platform.

153
00:07:33,720 --> 00:07:34,480
Director Li,

154
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:36,320
once this project is up and running,

155
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:38,690
it won't just create jobs
and generate tax revenue locally;;

156
00:07:38,690 --> 00:07:39,750
more importantly,

157
00:07:39,960 --> 00:07:41,320
it will serve as Shencheng's

158
00:07:41,320 --> 00:07:43,000
name card

159
00:07:43,360 --> 00:07:45,360
for international clothing trade.

160
00:07:47,320 --> 00:07:48,000
Ms. Xie,

161
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:50,700
you started out in clothing manufacturing.

162
00:07:50,720 --> 00:07:52,880
What made you decide to

163
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:55,010
build a platform on such a large scale?

164
00:07:55,600 --> 00:07:59,440
Every city has its own starting point.

165
00:08:00,720 --> 00:08:01,640
And this

166
00:08:03,080 --> 00:08:05,080
is the starting point of Shencheng.

167
00:08:13,770 --> 00:08:15,200
Where are we going?

168
00:08:15,600 --> 00:08:17,400
Don't be so impatient.

169
00:08:18,000 --> 00:08:19,200
We'll be there soon.

170
00:08:47,760 --> 00:08:48,600
What's wrong?

171
00:08:49,720 --> 00:08:51,600
Even a sky full of stars isn't

172
00:08:52,080 --> 00:08:54,410
as pretty as the streetlights down there?

173
00:08:55,520 --> 00:08:58,200
I was wondering what that piece of land

174
00:08:59,440 --> 00:09:01,040
will look like in the future.

175
00:09:01,680 --> 00:09:02,610
Look over there.

176
00:09:03,080 --> 00:09:05,360
That's where the nation's largest

177
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:08,320
clothing trade center will be built.

178
00:09:08,840 --> 00:09:11,400
It won't belong to me alone,

179
00:09:11,880 --> 00:09:12,680
but

180
00:09:13,640 --> 00:09:15,240
it will be built from scratch

181
00:09:15,490 --> 00:09:17,500
because I made it happen.

182
00:09:20,720 --> 00:09:22,580
How long do you think it will take?

183
00:09:23,920 --> 00:09:24,600
One year.

184
00:09:25,500 --> 00:09:26,300
One year?

185
00:09:27,560 --> 00:09:28,520
That fast?

186
00:09:29,400 --> 00:09:30,280
Of course.

187
00:09:30,280 --> 00:09:32,810
Are you underestimating Shencheng's speed?

188
00:09:33,320 --> 00:09:34,720
Ms. Xie, may I ask,

189
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:37,400
what role do you see

190
00:09:38,600 --> 00:09:39,480
me

191
00:09:40,320 --> 00:09:42,180
playing in your business empire?

192
00:09:46,440 --> 00:09:48,280
General agent for Island business.

193
00:09:48,280 --> 00:09:50,200
But this position

194
00:09:50,200 --> 00:09:52,880
comes with a hidden requirement.

195
00:09:53,120 --> 00:09:54,200
That is,

196
00:09:57,640 --> 00:10:00,240
it must be someone
I can lean on whenever I want.

197
00:10:03,200 --> 00:10:04,330
It would be my honor.

198
00:10:12,600 --> 00:10:13,280
Wan,

199
00:10:13,440 --> 00:10:15,560
recently, a woman named Xie Nanfeng

200
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:17,120
is building some sort of
clothing trade center

201
00:10:17,120 --> 00:10:19,000
next to our territory.

202
00:10:19,200 --> 00:10:21,800
They've announced that
the first six months are rent-free.

203
00:10:21,800 --> 00:10:24,160
The vendors around here
are all tempted to move over.

204
00:10:24,160 --> 00:10:26,520
If they all leave,

205
00:10:26,680 --> 00:10:28,340
our protection money will...

206
00:10:28,880 --> 00:10:30,680
Six months rent-free?

207
00:10:31,160 --> 00:10:33,420
Isn't it taking the bread out of my mouth?

208
00:10:33,480 --> 00:10:34,720
In this territory,

209
00:10:34,960 --> 00:10:37,080
no one dares to take food off my table.
